<main class="min-w-0 flex-1 p-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-14 pb-24 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-700">

        <header>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">Support</p>
            <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-gray-900">Get unstuck</h1>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Check the fixes below first. Most problems take under a minute. If yours isn't here, report it and we'll look.</p>
        </header>

        <section class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <a href="/documentation" class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-gray-400">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gray-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"/></svg>
                <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-gray-900">Read the docs</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Every feature, step by step.</p></a>
            <a href="#fixes" class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-gray-400">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gray-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17 17.25 21A2.652 2.652 0 0 0 21 17.25l-5.877-5.877M11.42 15.17l2.496-3.03c.317-.384.74-.626 1.208-.766M11.42 15.17l-4.655 5.653a2.548 2.548 0 1 1-3.586-3.586l6.837-5.63m5.108-.233c.55-.164 1.163-.188 1.743-.14a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.486-6.336l-3.276 3.277a3.004 3.004 0 0 1-2.25-2.25l3.276-3.276a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-6.336 4.486c.091 1.076-.071 2.264-.904 2.95l-.102.085m-1.745 1.437L5.909 7.5H4.5L2.25 3.75l1.5-1.5L7.5 4.5v1.409l4.26 4.26m-1.745 1.437 1.745-1.437"/></svg>
                <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-gray-900">Quick fixes</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Common problems and answers.</p></a>
            <a href="https://github.com/Tolaj/tailwind-ui-components/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-gray-400">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gray-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/></svg>
                <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-gray-900">Report a problem</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Opens a GitHub issue.</p></a>
        </section>

        <section id="fixes" class="scroll-mt-24">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Quick fixes</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
                <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
                    <thead class="bg-gray-50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2.5">What you see</th><th class="px-4 py-2.5">Try this</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 align-top">
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">The preview is blank</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Wait a second or two: it loads Tailwind from the internet. If it stays blank, check your connection and that your code has a visible element (a <code class="font-mono text-[13px]">&lt;div&gt;</code> with text, for example).</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">I can't click things in the preview</td><td class="px-4 py-3">You are in <strong>Edit</strong> mode, where clicks select elements. Switch to <strong>Preview</strong> (top bar) to use buttons and menus.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">AI says it is not enabled</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Click your avatar in the main app, open <em>AI Settings</em>, switch it on and add your key or local address.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">AI says "API key not configured"</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Open AI Settings, choose Anthropic, paste a valid key and save. Keys are private to your account.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">AI doesn't match my style</td><td class="px-4 py-3">It can only copy what is in your library. Save a few components you like (from the gallery or your own) and make sure <em>Use as AI reference</em> is ticked on them. The chat shows which ones it used.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">My component isn't in the gallery</td><td class="px-4 py-3">It's private. Press <strong>Edit</strong>, click the title at the top, and set Visibility to <em>Public</em>.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">I can't save a new component</td><td class="px-4 py-3">The canvas must not be empty, and Title, Category and Description are required in the save dialog.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">My JavaScript doesn't work in the preview</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Make sure it is inside a <code class="font-mono text-[13px]">&lt;script&gt;</code> tag after the elements it uses, and use <strong>Preview</strong> mode. The preview is sandboxed, so things like saved browser storage are not available there.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">Claude says it can't connect to the connector</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Open <strong>Connect</strong> and press <strong>Run test</strong>. It checks each step Claude takes and tells you what to fix, usually the public HTTPS address (<code class="font-mono text-[13px]">PUBLIC_URL</code>).</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">My coding agent can't connect</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Generate a fresh token in Library and run the new command (the old one stops working). Check the address in the command is your site's address and that it ends with <code class="font-mono text-[13px]">/mcp</code>.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">I lost my token</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Tokens are shown only once. Press <strong>Regenerate token</strong> and use the new one.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">I changed something by mistake</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Press <strong>History</strong> on the card and <strong>Restore</strong> an earlier version.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900">"Server error" when signing up or in</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Try again in a moment. If it keeps happening, report it with the steps below.</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Common questions</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 divide-y divide-gray-200 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
                <details class="group p-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-gray-900">Who can see my components?<span class="float-right text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm">Private ones, only you. Public ones, everyone (they appear in the gallery). You choose per component, and you can change it any time.</p></details>
                <details class="group p-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-gray-900">Does the AI read other people's components?<span class="float-right text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm">No. It only reads your own library. Gallery components reach it only if you press <em>Save to library</em> on them.</p></details>
                <details class="group p-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-gray-900">Does it cost anything?<span class="float-right text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm">The app doesn't charge for AI. If you use Anthropic, requests are billed by Anthropic to your own API key. A local model has no per-request cost.</p></details>
                <details class="group p-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-gray-900">If I delete a component, what happens to copies?<span class="float-right text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm">Copies other people saved are their own and are not affected. Your own deletion is permanent, so use History if you only want to undo changes.</p></details>
                <details class="group p-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-gray-900">Can I use components commercially?<span class="float-right text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm">Components you write are yours. For a public component made by someone else, check with its author before using it in a product.</p></details>
                <details class="group p-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-gray-900">Which frameworks can I export to?<span class="float-right text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm">Plain HTML, React (JSX), Vue 3 and Svelte. See <a href="/documentation#export" class="font-medium underline">Export</a>.</p></details>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Report a problem</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">Good reports get fixed faster. Please include:</p>
            <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm">
                <li><strong>What you did</strong>, step by step.</li>
                <li><strong>What you expected</strong> and <strong>what happened</strong> (a screenshot helps).</li>
                <li><strong>Your browser</strong> (for example Chrome 130).</li>
                <li>The <strong>code</strong> you pasted, if the problem is in the preview.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Never include your API key or MCP token in a report.</p>
            <a href="https://github.com/Tolaj/tailwind-ui-components/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-5 inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md bg-black px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-neutral-800">Open a GitHub issue</a>
        </section>

    </div>
</main>
